{
  "name": "视频分镜拆解与AI图片生成",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger-001",
      "name": "手动触发",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": {
          "enabled": false
        },
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "video_url",
              "name": "video_url",
              "value": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXAMPLE",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "replace_from",
              "name": "replace_from",
              "value": "cat",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "replace_to",
              "name": "replace_to",
              "value": "golden retriever dog",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "style_keywords",
              "name": "style_keywords",
              "value": "cinematic, nature documentary, 4K, warm lighting",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "num_scenes",
              "name": "num_scenes",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "input-params-002",
      "name": "输入参数",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [420, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent?key=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\"contents\": [{\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"你是一位专业的视频分镜师。请分析以下 YouTube 视频，将其拆解为\" + String($json.num_scenes) + \"个关键分镜。\\n\\nYouTube 视频链接：\" + String($json.video_url) + \"\\n\\n请严格按以下 JSON 数组格式输出，不要输出任何其他内容：\\n[\\n  {\\n    \\\"scene_number\\\": 1,\\n    \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"0:00-0:03\\\",\\n    \\\"description_cn\\\": \\\"中文画面描述\\\",\\n    \\\"text_to_image_prompt\\\": \\\"detailed English prompt for image generation, including composition, lighting, color palette, subject details, background, style\\\",\\n    \\\"mood\\\": \\\"氛围\\\",\\n    \\\"camera_movement\\\": \\\"如 static, slow zoom in, pan left, tracking shot\\\"\\n  }\\n]\\n\\n要求：\\n1. text_to_image_prompt 必须是英文，50-100词，足够详细以独立生成高质量图片\\n2. 覆盖视频的关键镜头，不遗漏重要画面\\n3. 每个提示词必须包含：主体描述、动作/姿态、环境、光线、构图、画面风格\\n4. 如果无法访问视频URL，根据链接中的标题/描述合理推断内容并生成分镜\"}]}], \"generationConfig\": {\"temperature\": 0.3, \"responseMimeType\": \"application/json\"}}) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "gemini-split-003",
      "name": "Gemini拆分镜",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [640, 400],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "wait-after-split-004",
      "name": "等待3秒",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [860, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 解析 Gemini 返回的分镜 JSON\nconst response = $input.first().json;\nconst inputParams = $('输入参数').item.json;\n\nlet scenes = [];\n\ntry {\n  const text = response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || '';\n  // 尝试提取 JSON 数组（可能被 markdown 代码块包裹）\n  const jsonMatch = text.match(/\\[\\s*\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}\\s*\\]/);\n  if (jsonMatch) {\n    scenes = JSON.parse(jsonMatch[0]);\n  } else {\n    scenes = JSON.parse(text);\n  }\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('分镜JSON解析失败');\n}\n\nif (!Array.isArray(scenes) || !scenes.length) throw new Error('分镜必须为非空数组');\nconst seen = new Set();\nfor (const scene of scenes) {\n  if (!scene || !Number.isSafeInteger(scene.scene_number) || scene.scene_number < 1 ||\n      typeof scene.text_to_image_prompt !== 'string' || !scene.text_to_image_prompt.trim() ||\n      seen.has(scene.scene_number)) throw new Error('分镜编号或提示词无效');\n  seen.add(scene.scene_number);\n}\n\nreturn scenes.map(scene => ({\n  json: {\n    ...scene,\n    video_url: inputParams.video_url,\n    replace_from: inputParams.replace_from,\n    replace_to: inputParams.replace_to,\n    style_keywords: inputParams.style_keywords\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "parse-scenes-005",
      "name": "解析分镜JSON",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1080, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "loop-scenes-006",
      "name": "遍历分镜",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1300, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.0-flash:generateContent?key=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\"contents\": [{\"parts\": [{\"text\": \"将以下图片生成提示词中的 '\" + String($json.replace_from) + \"' 相关元素替换为 '\" + String($json.replace_to) + \"'。这不是简单的文本替换，而是语义级替换——需要调整动作、姿态、场景细节以适配新的主体。同时在提示词末尾追加以下风格关键词：\" + String($json.style_keywords) + \"。\\n\\n只输出替换后的完整英文提示词，不要任何解释、编号或标签。\\n\\n原始提示词：\" + String($json.text_to_image_prompt) + \"\"}]}], \"generationConfig\": {\"temperature\": 0.2}}) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "gemini-replace-007",
      "name": "Gemini元素替换",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1520, 400],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 3,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "wait-after-replace-008",
      "name": "替换后等待",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1740, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 提取替换后的提示词\nconst response = $input.first().json;\nconst sceneData = $('遍历分镜').item.json;\n\nlet replacedPrompt = '';\ntry {\n  replacedPrompt = response.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || sceneData.text_to_image_prompt;\n  replacedPrompt = replacedPrompt.trim();\n} catch (e) {\n  replacedPrompt = sceneData.text_to_image_prompt;\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    scene_number: sceneData.scene_number,\n    timestamp: sceneData.timestamp,\n    description_cn: sceneData.description_cn,\n    text_to_image_prompt: sceneData.text_to_image_prompt,\n    replaced_prompt: replacedPrompt,\n    mood: sceneData.mood,\n    camera_movement: sceneData.camera_movement,\n    video_url: sceneData.video_url,\n    replace_from: sceneData.replace_from,\n    replace_to: sceneData.replace_to\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "extract-replaced-009",
      "name": "提取替换提示词",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1960, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8000/v1/images/generations",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer sk-no-key-required"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\"model\": \"jimeng-5.0\", \"prompt\": \"\" + String($json.replaced_prompt) + \"\", \"size\": \"1920x1080\", \"n\": 1}) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "jimeng-gen-010",
      "name": "即梦文生图",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2180, 400],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": ""
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "condition-has-image",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data && $json.data.length > 0 && $json.data[0].url }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "check-image-011",
      "name": "检查图片是否生成",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2400, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "image_url",
              "name": "image_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.data[0].url }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "图片已生成",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-success-012",
      "name": "设置成功状态",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [2620, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "image_url",
              "name": "image_url",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "待手动生图",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-fail-013",
      "name": "设置待手动状态",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [2620, 520]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "append",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "merge-status-014",
      "name": "合并状态",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [2840, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": "生产任务",
        "columns": {
          "mappingValues": [
            {
              "column": "原视频链接",
              "value": "={{ $('提取替换提示词').item.json.video_url }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "分镜序号",
              "value": "={{ $('提取替换提示词').item.json.scene_number }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "画面描述",
              "value": "={{ $('提取替换提示词').item.json.description_cn }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "原始提示词",
              "value": "={{ $('提取替换提示词').item.json.text_to_image_prompt }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "替换后提示词",
              "value": "={{ $('提取替换提示词').item.json.replaced_prompt }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "图片URL",
              "value": "={{ $json.image_url }}"
            },
            {
              "column": "视频提示词",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "column": "视频URL",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "column": "状态",
              "value": "={{ $json.status }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "USER_ENTERED",
          "valueInputMode": "RAW"
        }
      },
      "id": "write-sheet-015",
      "name": "写入生产任务",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [3060, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets OAuth2 API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 5,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "wait-between-scenes-016",
      "name": "分镜间等待",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [3280, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// 生成手动操作文档：筛选待手动生图的分镜\nconst allItems = $input.all();\nconst manualItems = allItems.filter(item => item.json.status === '待手动生图');\n\nif (manualItems.length === 0) {\n  return [{ json: { manual_doc: '所有分镜图片已自动生成，无需手动操作。', has_manual_tasks: false } }];\n}\n\nlet doc = '=== 待手动生图分镜清单 ===\\n\\n';\nfor (const item of manualItems) {\n  const d = item.json;\n  doc += `--- 分镜 ${d.scene_number || '?'} ---\\n`;\n  doc += `画面描述：${d.description_cn || ''}\\n`;\n  doc += `提示词：${d.replaced_prompt || d.text_to_image_prompt || ''}\\n\\n`;\n}\n\ndoc += `\\n共 ${manualItems.length} 个分镜需要手动生成图片。\\n请复制提示词到即梦/LiblibAI网页端生成后，将图片URL填回Google Sheets。`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { manual_doc: doc, has_manual_tasks: true, manual_count: manualItems.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "manual-doc-017",
      "name": "生成手动操作文档",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [3500, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 视频分镜拆解与AI图片生成\n\n### 使用前请替换：\n\n1. **YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY** → Google AI Studio 获取的免费 API Key\n   （https://aistudio.google.com/apikey）\n\n2. **YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID** → Google Sheets 电子表格 ID\n   （从 URL 中获取）\n\n3. **YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID** → n8n 中 Google Sheets OAuth2 凭证\n\n### 前置条件：\n- Docker 即梦 API 正在运行（端口 8000）\n- Google Sheets 中已创建「生产任务」Sheet\n\n### 如果即梦积分用完：\n- 查看生产任务 Sheet 中「待手动生图」的行\n- 复制替换后提示词到即梦/LiblibAI 网页端生成\n- 将图片 URL 填回 Sheet\n\n### API 配额：\n- Gemini 免费：每天 1,500 次\n- 每个视频约消耗 20-30 次\n- 即梦每次生成约 2-5 秒",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-018",
      "name": "使用说明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-200, 200]
    }
  ],
